<title>USA: U.S. blue chips rise in initial dealings.</title>
<headline>U.S. blue chips rise in initial dealings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. blue chip stocks rose in early dealings, helped by the firmer bonds and higher S&amp;P 500 futures.</p>
<p>At 0934/1334 GMT the Dow was up 19.97 points or 0.25 percent at 7714.63 points.</p>
<p>Nasdaq was off 0.73 point at 1561.30.</p>
<p>The long bond was up 2/32 to yield 6.54 percent.</p>
<p>((Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
